{"id":"4432074d06eed551","group":"43","path":"43/43-thm-apriori-semimeasure.md","title":"Universality of Discrete A Priori Probability","display":"thm-apriori-semimeasure — Universality of Discrete A Priori Probability","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Algorithmic Randomness and Complexity","book_abbrev":"43","label":"43-thm-apriori-semimeasure","aliases":["43-thm-apriori-semimeasure"],"display":"thm-apriori-semimeasure — Universality of Discrete A Priori Probability","depends_on":["[[43-df-apriori]]","[[43-df-discrete-semimeasure]]","[[43-df-universal-prefix-machine]]"],"source_book":"Rodney G. Downey and Denis R. Hirschfeldt, Algorithmic Randomness and Complexity","source_version":"Draft, 2007-07-28; supplied PDF, 629 pages","source_location":"§6.9 and Theorems 6.9.2, 6.9.4","source_printed_pages":"106–107","source_pdf_pages":"126–127","verification_status":"source-statement-checked","source_statement_checked":true,"source_proof_checked":false},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Algorithmic Randomness and Complexity"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"43"},{"key":"label","html":"43-thm-apriori-semimeasure"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>43-thm-apriori-semimeasure</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-apriori-semimeasure — Universality of Discrete A Priori Probability"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"cfad5734457defe6\" href=\"?note=cfad5734457defe6\" title=\"43-df-apriori\">43-df-apriori</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"2352967b8ac4bcf4\" href=\"?note=2352967b8ac4bcf4\" title=\"43-df-discrete-semimeasure\">43-df-discrete-semimeasure</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"f5078ab697e20add\" href=\"?note=f5078ab697e20add\" title=\"43-df-universal-prefix-machine\">43-df-universal-prefix-machine</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_book","html":"Rodney G. Downey and Denis R. Hirschfeldt, Algorithmic Randomness and Complexity"},{"key":"source_version","html":"Draft, 2007-07-28; supplied PDF, 629 pages"},{"key":"source_location","html":"§6.9 and Theorems 6.9.2, 6.9.4"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"106–107"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"126–127"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"source-statement-checked"},{"key":"source_statement_checked","html":"true"},{"key":"source_proof_checked","html":"false"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"U\">\\(U\\)</span> 满足 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{UniversalPF}(U)\">\\(\\mathrm{UniversalPF}(U)\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbf m_U\">\\(\\mathbf m_U\\)</span> 与相应谓词见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"cfad5734457defe6\" href=\"?note=cfad5734457defe6\" title=\"43-df-apriori\">43-df-apriori</a>、<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"2352967b8ac4bcf4\" href=\"?note=2352967b8ac4bcf4\" title=\"43-df-discrete-semimeasure\">43-df-discrete-semimeasure</a>。</p>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{UniversalDiscreteSemimeasure}\">\\(\\mathrm{UniversalDiscreteSemimeasure}\\)</span> 采用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"2352967b8ac4bcf4\" href=\"?note=2352967b8ac4bcf4\" title=\"43-df-discrete-semimeasure\">43-df-discrete-semimeasure</a> 的同名符号。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{UniversalDiscreteSemimeasure}(\\mathbf m_U).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{UniversalDiscreteSemimeasure}(\\mathbf m_U).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>Kraft 给出总质量界，停机枚举给出统一下近似。对任意有效离散半测度，用 KC 编码各输出的质量可得其被通用输出半测度以常数倍支配。</p>\n<p>来源：所给 2007-07-28 草稿，§6.9 and Theorems 6.9.2, 6.9.4；印刷页 106–107，PDF 页 126–127。本次逐项核对陈述；来源证明的已读范围见本次审阅账本，未作机器形式验证。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"43-df-apriori","status":"resolved","id":"cfad5734457defe6","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[43-df-apriori]]","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-discrete-semimeasure","status":"resolved","id":"2352967b8ac4bcf4","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[43-df-discrete-semimeasure]]","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-universal-prefix-machine","status":"resolved","id":"f5078ab697e20add","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[43-df-universal-prefix-machine]]","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-apriori","status":"resolved","id":"cfad5734457defe6","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$U$ 满足 $\\mathrm{UniversalPF}(U)$，$\\mathbf m_U$ 与相应谓词见 [[43-df-apriori]]、[[43-df-discrete-semimeasure]]。","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-discrete-semimeasure","status":"resolved","id":"2352967b8ac4bcf4","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$U$ 满足 $\\mathrm{UniversalPF}(U)$，$\\mathbf m_U$ 与相应谓词见 [[43-df-apriori]]、[[43-df-discrete-semimeasure]]。","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-discrete-semimeasure","status":"resolved","id":"2352967b8ac4bcf4","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{UniversalDiscreteSemimeasure}$ 采用 [[43-df-discrete-semimeasure]] 的同名符号。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"U","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{UniversalPF}(U)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathbf m_U","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{UniversalDiscreteSemimeasure}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{UniversalDiscreteSemimeasure}(\\mathbf m_U).","display":true}],"bytes":1